{
  "annotations": [
    {
      "start_time": 0,
      "end_time": 22,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The way Lucy moves backwards into the wardrobe seems like she's playing hide and seek. She doesn't expect anything to be behind her but more clothes. She's hiding in a wardrobe, a very mundane place for a child to hide. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "Genres",
          "tag": "Fantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Fantasy",
          "tag": "Worldbuilding"
        },
        {
          "category": "Fantasy",
          "tag": "Portal Fantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Fantasy",
          "tag": "Magic System"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "5503bc2d-36cd-4786-ae8b-5a5f2f7a641a"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 23,
      "end_time": 32,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "She slowly turns around to investigate why she felt the cold of snow on her fingertips, and then quickly looks back, to make sure no one is following her. It's almost like she doesn't want to get into trouble for going somewhere she isn't supposed to go. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
